WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:03.878
Hey everyone.

00:00:04.045 --> 00:00:05.755
I'm YaYa Gosselin, and I play Sam.

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:07.632
And I'm Miya Cech, and I play Jade.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:08.717
And we are...

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.135
The Surfside Girls!

00:00:11.761 --> 00:00:14.723
Surfside Girls is based on the graphic novels by Kim Dwinell.

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:17.642
It's about these two best friends, Jade and Sam.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:18.852
They've been friends for a long time.

00:00:18.893 --> 00:00:19.811
They love surfing.

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:20.395
Later dude.

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:22.439
And they're like complete opposites.

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:24.983
Definitely a yin and yang situation.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:25.608
Totally.

00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:29.487
Jade Lee is this very smart, witty person.

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:30.780
She loves science.

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:32.532
She kind of sees the world as an equation.

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:34.701
Everything has to add up and science and logic.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:35.869
Therefore, does that mean

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.245
I don't really believe in myself?

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:39.956
Jade. Jade. Hi. You're in a hypothesis spiral.

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:44.794
Sam is this bold and fearless girl.

00:00:44.836 --> 00:00:46.629
And has a little bit of a mischievous side.

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:48.381
It's getting rough out there.

00:00:48.631 --> 00:00:49.549
Maybe we should call it a day?

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:50.425
Never!

00:00:50.675 --> 00:00:52.802
She also has a really big imagination.

00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:54.804
And she's more into the supernatural than

00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:56.389
the science side of everything.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:57.599
Holy frijoles!

00:00:57.849 --> 00:00:59.559
But what draws them together is

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:02.437
that love for mystery and investigating.

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:03.229
So mysterious.

00:01:03.354 --> 00:01:03.646
I love it.

00:01:03.646 --> 00:01:06.524
So Sam, one day, wipes out on her surfboard.

00:01:06.524 --> 00:01:06.900
Sam!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:10.153
And she finds this magical cavern with a doubloon.

00:01:10.195 --> 00:01:12.238
I found this potentially cursed treasure,

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:13.573
and now I'm haunted by a ghost!

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:15.325
How hard did you hit your head?

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:16.076
What are you doing?

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:19.662
It's not until Jade sees Sam walk through a wall.

00:01:19.704 --> 00:01:22.540
Maybe ghosts do exist.

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:24.417
Perhaps a 100% chance.

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:27.003
That's when Jade knows this is not one of Sam's stories.

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:28.254
This, this is real.

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:29.422
She saw a ghost.

00:01:30.215 --> 00:01:31.007
Behold.

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:32.550
The Obsidian Flyer!

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:36.888
Remi is played by Spencer Hermes Rebello.

00:01:37.013 --> 00:01:38.139
I did not know that.

00:01:38.181 --> 00:01:39.933
Please walk me down the memory plank.

00:01:40.016 --> 00:01:42.018
He's this funny 14 year old ghost pirate.

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:45.563
And I've never, ever said "Boo!" Until now.

00:01:45.563 --> 00:01:48.441
And he is kind of childlike. Very naive and innocent.

00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:49.317
How will we get in?

00:01:49.818 --> 00:01:51.069
Right. I'm a ghost.

00:01:51.194 --> 00:01:53.988
And they're going through this adventure like Three Musketeers.

00:01:53.988 --> 00:01:57.492
And the mystery is why their beautiful cliffside, Danger Point,

00:01:57.492 --> 00:02:01.663
is slowly eroding away, and a ghost pirate ship disappearing with it.

00:02:01.871 --> 00:02:04.207
I fear by summer's end there will be nothing left.

00:02:04.249 --> 00:02:06.501
So Sam and Jade need to help Remi to save Surfside.

00:02:06.751 --> 00:02:08.211
I mean, if that whole cliff crumbles...

00:02:08.336 --> 00:02:10.463
A horrific ancient evil will be unleashed.

00:02:10.588 --> 00:02:11.339
(lightening cracks)

00:02:12.215 --> 00:02:13.842
Okay let's not get dramatic.

00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:16.719
I absolutely loved the script because it

00:02:16.719 --> 00:02:19.514
featured two strong, minority female leads,

00:02:19.514 --> 00:02:20.682
which I think is awesome.

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:22.392
They represent something so special.

00:02:22.433 --> 00:02:24.435
I've never seen a young Mexican surfer before.

00:02:24.435 --> 00:02:26.479
And to get to set that example for young girls,

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:27.480
that you can do anything.

00:02:27.564 --> 00:02:29.232
You know, it doesn't matter what you look like.

00:02:29.232 --> 00:02:29.816
Paddle out again?

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:30.942
Race you to the next one.

00:02:32.777 --> 00:02:33.695
Have you ever surfed before?

00:02:33.695 --> 00:02:34.195
Yeah.
You have?

00:02:34.195 --> 00:02:34.821
Yeah, I have.

00:02:34.904 --> 00:02:35.738
Okay, I haven't.

00:02:35.864 --> 00:02:36.781
A little secret here:

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:38.992
I am not coordinated. At all.

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:41.286
But I got a lesson. Once I got out on the water,

00:02:41.286 --> 00:02:42.537
it was just really wonderful.

00:02:42.871 --> 00:02:44.831
Just like super fun, super cold.

00:02:44.873 --> 00:02:45.748
Yeah!

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:48.793
I really have never had an experience like this.

00:02:48.918 --> 00:02:50.587
Everyday it was like a new adventure.

00:02:50.628 --> 00:02:52.130
Who knows what we'll find out.

00:02:52.255 --> 00:02:54.424
Fans of the books are really going to be excited

00:02:54.424 --> 00:02:56.134
to see these two girls come to life.

00:02:56.301 --> 00:02:57.635
The Surfside Girls are back!

00:02:57.677 --> 00:02:58.845
Definitely tell everybody.

